      "knowledge_access": "[CHARACTER KNOWLEDGE ACCESS]\nFacts: F1 campaign_fact_nicco_light_mage \"Nicco is a Light mage.\" | F2 campaign_fact_nicco_otherworlder \"Nicco came to this world from another world.\"\nNarration and Nicco (player): F1, F2. Nicco's speech and decisions still belong to the player.\nPellan: CAN USE none; DO NOT USE F1, F2\nA character may voice or act on only the facts listed CAN USE for them (believes/suspects/heard_rumor: only as belief, suspicion or rumor). DO NOT USE also covers hints, rumors, \"everyone says\" talk and claims that imply the fact; do not invent rumors or public talk to get around it. DO NOT USE is this turn's permission, not proof of ignorance: that character may ask, say they have not heard, or defer to someone who can use it.",
      "scene_section": "[CURRENT AUTHORITATIVE SCENE]\nLocation: Calderan Center District. The Center District is Calderan's wealthiest and politically most important district, enclosed by an older inner wall. It contains the Duke's political seat, the Magistracy, major administrative offices, noble households, institutional branches and local guild-branch headquarters, Church influence and prestigious professional services. It is never exclusively noble. These are predominant tendencies, not exclusive zoning. Crossing substantial parts of a district is meaningful travel; no exact roads or navigation routes are established.\nWorld minute: 0. Player mana: 100/100.\nLocal ancestry and features: {\"ancestry\":[{\"id\":\"calderan\",\"name\":\"Calderan\",\"display_name\":\"Calderan\",\"summary\":\"Calderan is West's inland capital, main political center, and main campaign city.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"west\",\"name\":\"West\",\"display_name\":\"West (nation)\",\"summary\":\"West is the western nation, broadly mild, temperate, and greener; Calderan is its capital.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"continent\",\"name\":\"Known Continent\",\"display_name\":\"Known Continent\",\"summary\":\"An enormous known continent comprises West, Center, and East, arranged from west to east.\",\"secret\":false}],\"features\":[]}\n[NICCO / PLAYER PROFILE]\nNarrator-facing truth about the player character, not NPC knowledge. Others may perceive only his observable appearance; any other detail here is usable by an NPC only when [CHARACTER KNOWLEDGE ACCESS] lists it for them. Nicco's dialogue, thoughts, intentions and deliberate actions come only from the player.\nNicco is a 35-year-old human man. He was transported into this world from another world approximately one day before the campaign begins, and he has essentially no prior lived knowledge of this world unless explicitly established later. On arrival he became the lawful owner/holder of Heartstone Tower. He is tall and overweight, with a few visible white hairs and very mild, early balding; no further appearance details are established. His magical affinity/school is Light. His currently known Light subschools are healing and sacrifice, understood only within the existing magic framework; no mechanics for sacrifice are established. Being a Light mage gives him no automatic knowledge of spells, institutions, lore, or magical theory. Nicco is the player character: his dialogue, thoughts, intentions, and deliberate actions are supplied only by the player.\nHousehold: Heartstone (owner).\n[CURRENT AUTHORITATIVE CHARACTERS]\nPortrayal fields guide NPC behavior only. Purpose is not a campaign goal. Morality/private notes/personality never grant Nicco or other NPCs knowledge; do not recite them as public facts.\nCharacter Nicco (nicco): {\"profile\":{\"name\":\"Nicco\",\"aliases\":[]},\"current\":{\"current_location\":\"calderan_center\"},\"canonical_awareness\":[]}\nCharacter Pellan (pellan): {\"baseline\":{\"id\":\"pellan\",\"name\":\"Pellan\",\"display_name\":\"Pellan\",\"summary\":\"Pellan is a minor but experienced clerk of Calderan's Civil Registry and Archive in the Central District.\",\"secret\":false,\"appearance\":\"Thin and slightly hunched, with messy hair, thick round spectacles, permanently ink-stained fingers, and rumpled, modest, somewhat shabby clothing.\",\"portrayal\":{\"purpose\":\"Keep civil records correct and comprehensible and survive his bureaucratic career without becoming entangled in dangerous political, magical or extraordinary affairs.\",\"morality\":\"Fundamentally honest and uncomfortable with deliberate harm. May tolerate harmless procedural shortcuts but strongly resists falsifying records, abusing authority or knowingly ruining somebody through bureaucracy.\",\"personality\":[\"anxious\",\"pedantic\",\"conscientious\",\"verbose\",\"easily overwhelmed\",\"Prone to fainting when confronted with severe shocks, extraordinary revelations or situations far beyond his ability to process.\"],\"affiliations\":[],\"authority\":\"narrator_portrayal_only_not_character_knowledge\"},\"content\":\"Pellan is a human man, an adult approximately in middle age, and a minor but experienced civil-record clerk at Calderan's Civil Registry and Archive in the Central District.\",\"traits\":[\"anxious\",\"pedantic\",\"conscientious\",\"verbose\",\"easily overwhelmed\",\"Prone to fainting when confronted with severe shocks, extraordinary revelations or situations far beyond his ability to process.\"]},\"profile\":{\"name\":\"Pellan\",\"aliases\":[]},\"current\":{\"current_location\":\"calderan_center\"},\"canonical_awareness\":[]}\n[CURRENT EQUIPMENT]\nVisible carried/equipped items (ownership and positions are authoritative): []\nScheduled events: []",
